# FP-reasoning: HIGH, plain. CVE-2017-9805 Apache Struts2 REST plugin XStream
# deserialization RCE. Clean-room from advisory. Scope http.request_body
# (XML body via the REST endpoint). fast_pattern
# "jdk.nashorn.internal" (20B) -> the Nashorn engine class used by the public
# gadget chain is attacker-unique inside an XML payload. pcre confirms the
