# action evaluates a `queryEditor` PHP expression from the body). Clean-room
# from advisory. Two-buffer: http.uri.raw "/wp-json/bricks/v1/render_element"
# (fast_pattern) + http.request_body pcre requires the queryEditor sink in a
# JSON gadget (eval / file_get_contents / phpinfo / passthru / system).
