# brands: D-Link, TP-Link, Edimax, Tenda, etc.). Network-detectable via
# UDP/9034 NetCore/Cudy probe → here we cover the HTTP-side variant via
# CGI `formSysCmd` or `boafrm/formSysCmd` (the same Realtek BoA web server
# also exposes the command sink over HTTP on some firmwares). Clean-room
# from advisory. Scope http.uri.raw. fast_pattern "formSysCmd" + pcre
# requires the sysCmd= injection parameter with a shell metachar. Negative:
# a docs URL mentioning formSysCmd → pcre rejects (no sysCmd= + metachar).
