# string as a shell command. Stupidly trivial, still Mirai-recruited daily
# (18 real-traffic hits in AUDIT-REALGAP). Clean-room from advisory. Scope
# http.uri.raw. fast_pattern "/shell?" + pcre requires a shell command
# pattern (cd /, wget, curl, busybox) in the query → benign URL never has
# this combo. Negative: a docs path containing /shell? without a cmd-like
# payload → pcre rejects.
